SUMMARY:The Willow Snags Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:The Melon Ball in Davis presents… \nThe Willow Snags (Sacramento\, CA) are a rock band rooted in the blues and psychedelia of the 1960s. Typically found performing 2 – 3 hour sets in local haunts and dive bars in the Sacramento area\, The Willow Snags had the honor of opening up for the legendary 4 Non Blondes at the Great American Music Hall on 12/17/2025. \nFeaturing the talents of UC Davis alumni Mia Mercado on electric organ/vocals\, UC Davis alumni Diego Martinez-Campos on percussion\, Joshua Williams on lead guitar\, Marisol Werner on rhythm guitar\, and Johnny Mercado on vocals. \nAlaskan Bull Worm – Video\nSister – Video \nInstagram\nSpotify\nApple Music \n$15 General Admission\nDoors open at 7:30pm\nThis is a BYOB Event!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/the-willow-snags-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, DAVIS\, CA\, 95616\, United States
