LAST-MODIFIED:20260716T173026Z
UID:10002900-1785009600-1785018600@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Adrian West Band Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Adrian West Band returns to Davis for another night of great live music. Performing as a six-piece band with pianist (Michael Echaniz) on the Steinway grand piano they’ll play their signature mix of original acoustic rock\, a couple covers and few jazz tunes. Some describe their sound as “Paul Simon meets Talking Heads”. The band will include two vocalists\, acoustic guitar\, piano\, electric violin\, alto sax\, upright bass\, drums & live looping. More info coming soon. \nThis is a BYOB show! \n$20 General Admission\n$15 Students (w/student ID\, in-store or at the door only)\nKids under 12 FREE\nDoors open at 7:30
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/adrian-west-band-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, DAVIS\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/AdrianWest-2-s6yQyW.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Visit Davis": "https://visitdavis.org/event/open-mic-music-trivia/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:visitdavis
X-SOURCE:Visit Davis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T200000
DTSTAMP:20260716T173024Z
CREATED:20260623T173042Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260716T173024Z
UID:10002895-1785088800-1785096000@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Open Mic & Music Trivia
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by Jordyn Micke. \nCome beat the heat and join us in the air-conditioned Melon Ball in Davis for the July Open Mic! We will continue to feature our Music Trivia contest throughout the evening in between acts. The winner will receive a $20 Watermelon Music gift card! \nWhether you’re looking for a venue to share your own talents or just looking to enjoy hearing (and seeing) some local performers\, we invite you to this free monthly event. We provide the sound\, stage and lights – the rest is up to you. Play us your favorite song\, tell us some jokes\, act out a scene from your favorite play with friends. \nWe ask only that each performance be suitable for an all-ages venue\, and that you arrive on time and stay until the end to support your fellow performers. \nFREE!!!\nDoors open/sign-ups @ 5:30.\nFirst act @ 6:00. \nWe hope to see you there!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/open-mic-music-trivia/
LOCATION:Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, DAVIS\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/July2026-1-Ichrpv.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
